        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy Krea-2- Text to Image\n\nGenerate images from text prompts using Krea 2, a foundation model built for aesthetic quality and creative control. It focuses on rendering expressive and artistic styles. Ideal for concept art exploration, visual brainstorming, and creating stylized imagery for design projects. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs a COMFY_API_KEY.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/image_krea2_turbo_t2i.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
        },
