          "value": "A high-resolution, surreal digital illustration showing a human hand holding a martini glass. The image is overlaid with whimsical, expressive ink-style doodles, including a cartoon figure inside the glass, a drawn citrus wedge on the rim, and various abstract sketches and faces surrounding the glass against a clean, white background. The style seamlessly blends a realistic, lit photograph with loose, hand-drawn marker artistry, creating a playful and artistic juxtaposition."
